msgid "Reviewbird"
msgstr "Reviewbird"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: reviewbird-plugin.php
msgid "https://reviewbird.com"
msgstr "https://reviewbird.com"

#. Description of the plugin
#: reviewbird-plugin.php
msgid "Automated review collection for WooCommerce that blocks spam, catches complaints, and showcases your best feedback."
msgstr "スパムをブロックし、苦情をキャッチし、最高のフィードバックを紹介するWooCommerce向けの自動レビュー収集ツールです。"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:74
msgid "Hey, there! It looks like you enjoy collecting product reviews with Reviewbird. Would you do us a favor and take a few seconds to give us a review? We’d love to hear from you."
msgstr "こんにちは！Reviewbirdで商品レビューを集めるのを楽しんでいるようですね。よろしければ、数秒だけお時間をいただき、レビューをお願いできますか？ぜひあなたの声をお聞かせください。"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:76
msgid "Ok, you deserve it"
msgstr "はい、あなたにふさわしいです"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:78
msgid "Nope, maybe later"
msgstr "いいえ、また今度にします"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:80
msgid "I already did"
msgstr "もう済ませました"

